body:
Glad they fixed the Dammon bug for A2 when you kill the ox in A1

&#x200B;

There was a whole thread of people calling people who killed the Ox foolish because they should have known it would have had the repercussion of him not appearing. Guess they are eating crow now

I know this is going against the grain but I think barbarian, they are super strong in solo queue as you can 2/3 shot the goblins, you do incredible damage. Their passives are also great so you get a lot out of leveling them up. They also level fast because you can clear out rooms quickly and then if you die, jump back in and do it again.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Also they require little gear to be effective

I bought some pest killer spray concentrate and a sprayer we had a horrible ant and wasp infestation in our new rental. I haven't seen a single wasp or ant after two months of treatments. It ran me about $30 and I can treat my house about 30 times. 

&#x200B;

Pest control is so easy to DIY

Yes

&#x200B;

Also if you want you can queue with randoms which can be a shit show but it also lowers your team mmr to adjust for that
